SNAFUEL V1.2 - README
---------------------

This file is for users of V1.1 who wish to upgrade to V1.2  New users should use the full instructions.

To upgrade from V1.1, replace the old SNAFUEL1.APP file with the new SNAFUEL2.APP and remove the old OVL files from the \APP\SNAFUEL\ directory.

1.    If you are using the optional On-Line Help (Highly recommended) replace the file SNAFUELH.OVL in the \APP\SNAFUEL\ directory.

2.    If you are using the optional Print option replace the file S3AFUELP.OVL in the \APP\SNAFUEL\ directory.

The following enhancements have been added.

a.    The Statistics screen has been enhanced.

b.    A new Oil Change/Servicing reminder option has been added.

Hope you like the improvements.

Al
